WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.610
- Well, we need to talk
about SNL a little bit.

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:03.420
I've asked because this
is the funniest thing

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.730
that's happened on my show.

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:08.040
I've asked Jimmy, Seth,
and Maya about this

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.010
because it was apparently an epic night,

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.450
but what do you remember

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.210
from the SNL 40th anniversary party?

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:15.930
And does it involve Prince?

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.293
- [Leslie] No!

00:00:17.293 --> 00:00:18.126
- Oh!

00:00:18.126 --> 00:00:19.760
- But the 40th was off the chain for me,

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.160
'cause it was like, one of the first like,

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.940
big seasons I was at SNL.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.590
So, I had met famous people,

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:28.610
but the 40th was (gasps) famous people.

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.390
Like, I met Leonardo DiCaprio.

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:35.210
I met all kinds of-- but
this is the best story

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:36.360
for me, for the 40th.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.760
I don't know if people remember this,

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.410
but we were standing in the
back just partying, man.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:41.540
I'm like, I'm partying.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.170
And I looked to the back,
everybody's getting up there,

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:46.800
you know, Dan Aykroyd, Jimmy
Fallon up there singing,

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.540
you know, "Come on--",
you know, just going off,

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.050
you know, it was awesome, right?

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.710
So, I look back, (laughing)
I look in the back.

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:56.610
Michael Bolton is standing in the back

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:58.707
and he's just looking like,

00:00:58.707 --> 00:01:02.013
"Man, I want to get up there, man.

00:01:02.013 --> 00:01:04.813
Man, I wish somebody would
ask me to get up there, man."

00:01:06.349 --> 00:01:08.137
He was just looking around, like,

00:01:08.137 --> 00:01:10.180
"Do they know that Michael
Bolton's in the back?

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:12.200
I don't think they know Michael
Bolton was in the back."

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.486
So, I went over to him. I
was like, "Michael Bolton."

00:01:13.486 --> 00:01:14.650
I was like, "Do you want to sing tonight?"

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:17.540
And he was like, "Nah."

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:18.830
Now, you know know he's
trying to play that--

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:20.740
I was like, "No, Michael
Bolton, you're going to sing!"

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.760
He let me pull him to the front,

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.330
pulled him to the front,
right? Pulled him to the front.

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:26.777
And I waved Jimmy. I was like,

00:01:26.777 --> 00:01:28.340
"Jimmy, Jimmy, Michael Bolton!"

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:30.260
He was like, "Oh, Michael Bolton."

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:31.490
Let me tell you something.

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:36.490
Michael Bolton got up
there and shut it down.

00:01:37.037 --> 00:01:42.037
♪ When a man loves a woman ♪
(audience clapping)

00:01:42.554 --> 00:01:44.443
Everybody was like, "Ahh!"

00:01:46.007 --> 00:01:47.540
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.970
- Afterwards, I think his
publicist came up to me.

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:52.600
She was like, "You made his night!"

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.810
I was like, "He made our night!"

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:55.643
Like, yeah.
- Oh my gosh,

00:01:55.643 --> 00:01:57.390
I love his voice so badly.

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:00.617
- He-- I'm talking about
everybody's knees just went,

00:02:00.617 --> 00:02:02.957
"Aww, Michael Bolton!"

00:02:02.957 --> 00:02:05.320
- Yeah, that voice. Woo!

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:07.020
Sexy little rasp. Oh, I'm into it.

